    <summary>Firewall and intrusion protection for Windows Servers and PCs - bans password guessers and port scanners automatically.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Coinetic AI Security manages the built-in Windows Firewall on Windows Servers and PCs.

- Bans password guessers (Remote Desktop, Windows logons, VPN, SQL Server and more) and port scanners automatically with a firewall rule
- Keeps Remote Desktop closed until you unlock it from your phone
- Shows which programs go online and lets you allow or block them
- A security check with plain explanations and fixes you can undo
- Pro + AI adds an AI security analyst

Installed through Chocolatey it starts the **free 30-day trial** with all features - no payment details needed.

By installing you accept the licence agreement: https://coinetic.io/eula
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://coinetic.io/trust</releaseNotes>
